0..75 Comment "// What a function-typed field refuses. A W-type\'s node may hold a function"
76..155 Comment "// into its own family, but not from it: a family to the left of the arrow is a"
156..232 Comment "// negative occurrence, and no fold over it is well-founded. A definition of"
233..308 Comment "// the family\'s block stands for its body, so naming the family through one"
309..371 Comment "// hides nothing. Shared with `../../model/data/w-tree.gandr`."
